            <td style="padding: 12px 16px; font-weight: 600;">Maintenance Costs</td>
            <td style="padding: 12px 16px;">$0 (Landlord responsibility)</td>
            <td style="padding: 12px 16px;">Varies (Generally 1-2% of home value annually)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);">
            <td style="padding: 12px 16px; font-weight: 600;">Tax Implications</td>
            <td style="padding: 12px 16px;">Standard deduction only</td>
            <td style="padding: 12px 16px;">Potential mortgage interest and property tax deductions</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p class="text-body-md" style="color: var(--color-body); line-height: 28px;">
      Whether you need a <strong>simple mortgage calculator</strong> for a quick payment check, or a comprehensive <strong>mortgage payoff calculator</strong> to design an accelerated payment schedule, our suite helps you model scenarios to make a financially sound decision.
    </p>
